Activity 3 – Social Media Infographics & Project Documentation

Description

Developed a project proposal for VeriFact Health Hub, a platform promoting reliable health information, along with an educational infographic about Tirzepatide, health misinformation, and online information verification.

What Have I Learned?

Through this activity, I learned how to organize project ideas into a clear proposal and communicate important information through infographics. I also realized the importance of verifying information, especially when sharing health-related content online. Not everything we see on social media is accurate, so it is important to rely on credible sources.
